  <Sequence sap2010:Annotation.AnnotationText="- Overview (讀取SAP GUI畫面最下方的「狀態列(Status Bar)」訊息——也就是每次執行操作或BAPI後，SAP用來顯示「成功/警告/錯誤」訊息的那一整條橫幅。)&#xA;Return the specified properties of Gui Status Bar Object using SAP Gui Scripiting API. &#xA;&#xA;- Input/Output&#xA;out_MessageType as Message Type &lt;String&gt;&#xA;out_MessageId as Message ID &lt;String&gt;&#xA;out_MessageNumber as Message Number &lt;String&gt;&#xA;out_MessageText as Message Text &lt;String&gt;&#xA;&#xA;* MessageType summary&#xA;---------------------------&#xA;S = Success&#xA;W = Warning&#xA;E = Error&#xA;A = Abort&#xA;I = Information" DisplayName="SRC_Get_GuiStatusbar" sap:VirtualizedContainerService.HintSize="939,2089" sap2010:WorkflowViewState.IdRef="Sequence_1">
    <Sequence.Variables>
      <Variable x:TypeArguments="x:String" Default="SRC_Get_GuiStatusbar" Name="WorkflowName" />
    </Sequence.Variables>
    <sap:WorkflowViewStateService.ViewState>
