    </ui:LogMessage>
    <ui:Comment sap2010:Annotation.AnnotationText="用 InvokeCode（內嵌VB.NET程式碼）操作SAP GUI Scripting API&#xD;&#xA;跟 SRC_Get_GuiLabel.xaml 幾乎一模一樣的COM物件反射逐層挖取手法：&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;SapGuiAuto (GetObject(&quot;SAPGUI&quot;))&#xD;&#xA;  └─ application (GetScriptingEngine)&#xD;&#xA;       └─ connection (Children(0))&#xD;&#xA;            └─ session (Children(0))&#xD;&#xA;                 └─ ControlID = findById(&quot;wnd[0]/sbar&quot;)  ← 關鍵差異在這裡！&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;⚠️ 與SRC_Get_GuiLabel.xaml最大的不同：&#xD;&#xA;&gt; SRC_Get_GuiLabel.xaml 是用 findById(&quot;wnd[0]/&quot; &amp; in_ControlID) → 可以指定任意控件(彈性、通用)&#xD;&#xA;&gt; 這支 SRC_Get_GuiStatusbar.xaml 是寫死用 findById(&quot;wnd[0]/sbar&quot;) → sbar 就是SAP GUI裡狀態列的固定選擇器代碼，不需要輸入參數，因為狀態列在SAP畫面上永遠只有這一個固定位置&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;找到狀態列控件後，讀取四個專屬屬性：&#xD;&#xA;&gt; MessageType（訊息類型：S/W/E/A/I）→ out_MessageType&#xD;&#xA;&gt; MessageId（訊息類別ID）→ out_MessageId&#xD;&#xA;&gt; MessageNumber（訊息編號）→ out_MessageNumber&#xD;&#xA;&gt; Text（完整顯示文字）→ out_MessageText" sap:VirtualizedContainerService.HintSize="450,542" sap2010:WorkflowViewState.IdRef="Comment_2" Text="// Write your comments in the Text property">
      <sap:WorkflowViewStateService.ViewState>
        <scg:Dictionary x:TypeArguments="x:String, x:Object">
          <x:Boolean x:Key="IsAnnotationDocked">True</x:Boolean>
        </scg:Dictionary>
      </sap:WorkflowViewStateService.ViewState>
    </ui:Comment>
    <ui:Comment sap:VirtualizedContainerService.HintSize="450,147" sap2010:WorkflowViewState.IdRef="Comment_3" Text="同樣用巢狀 Try...Finally 逐層釋放COM物件（ControlID→session→connection→application→SapGuiAuto），並手動觸發垃圾回收，避免記憶體洩漏" />
    <ui:InvokeCode ContinueOnError="{x:Null}" Code="'-Begin-----------------------------------------------------------------&#xA;Dim SapGuiAuto As Object = Nothing&#xA;Try&#xA; SapGuiAuto = GetObject(&quot;SAPGUI&quot;)&#xA; Dim application As Object = Nothing&#xA; Try&#xA;  application = SapGuiAuto.GetType.InvokeMember(&quot;GetScriptingEngine&quot;, Reflection.BindingFlags.InvokeMethod, Nothing, SapGuiAuto, Nothing)&#xA;  Dim connection As Object = Nothing&#xA;  Try&#xA;   connection = application.GetType.InvokeMember(&quot;Children&quot;, Reflection.BindingFlags.GetProperty, Nothing, application, {0})&#xA;   Dim session As Object = Nothing&#xA;   Try&#xA;    session = connection.GetType.InvokeMember(&quot;Children&quot;, Reflection.BindingFlags.GetProperty, Nothing, connection, {0})&#xA;    Dim ControlID As Object = Nothing&#xA;    Try&#xA;     ControlID = session.GetType.InvokeMember(&quot;findById&quot;, Reflection.BindingFlags.InvokeMethod, Nothing, session, {&quot;wnd[0]/sbar&quot;})&#xA;     out_MessageType = CType(ControlID.GetType.InvokeMember(&quot;MessageType&quot;, Reflection.BindingFlags.GetProperty, Nothing, ControlID, Nothing), String)&#xA;     out_MessageId = CType(ControlID.GetType.InvokeMember(&quot;MessageId&quot;, Reflection.BindingFlags.GetProperty, Nothing, ControlID, Nothing), String)&#xA;     out_MessageNumber = CType(ControlID.GetType.InvokeMember(&quot;MessageNumber&quot;, Reflection.BindingFlags.GetProperty, Nothing, ControlID, Nothing), String)&#xA;     out_MessageText = CType(ControlID.GetType.InvokeMember(&quot;Text&quot;, Reflection.BindingFlags.GetProperty, Nothing, ControlID, Nothing), String)&#xA;    Finally&#xA;     Try&#xA;      System.Runtime.InteropServices.Marshal.ReleaseComObject(ControlID)&#xA;     Catch ex As Exception&#xA;     End Try&#xA;    End Try&#xA;   Finally&#xA;    Try&#xA;     System.Runtime.InteropServices.Marshal.ReleaseComObject(session)&#xA;    Catch ex As Exception&#xA;    End Try&#xA;   End Try   &#xA;  Finally&#xA;   Try&#xA;    System.Runtime.InteropServices.Marshal.ReleaseComObject(connection)&#xA;   Catch ex As Exception&#xA;   End Try&#xA;  End Try  &#xA; Finally&#xA;  Try&#xA;   System.Runtime.InteropServices.Marshal.ReleaseComObject(application)&#xA;  Catch ex As Exception&#xA;  End Try&#xA; End Try&#xA;Finally&#xA; Try&#xA;  System.Runtime.InteropServices.Marshal.FinalReleaseComObject(SapGuiAuto)&#xA;  System.GC.Collect()&#xA;  System.GC.WaitForPendingFinalizers()&#xA; Catch ex As Exception&#xA; End Try&#xA;End Try" DisplayName="Invoke code for GuiStatusbar" sap:VirtualizedContainerService.HintSize="450,287" sap2010:WorkflowViewState.IdRef="InvokeCode_1">
